  cat <<'HELP'
Usage: snails install-shim [--bin-dir DIR]

Write or update the spin/spinel PATH shims. Each shim delegates to
`snails exec`, so a pinned tree uses its toolchain and other trees
fall back to the standalone install.
HELP
}

help_help() {
  cat <<'HELP'
Usage: snails help [<command>|--all]

Show the public command list, one command's help, or all commands.
HELP
}

